review:
I played EVERY popular/big racing game out there: Froza Horizons, GT-s, all NFS-s, Grid, Juiced, Dirts and etc.

THIS is the ultimate drifting game:
- Best drift feeling overall;
- Great car customization and tuning;
- Great balance between arcade and simulation;
- Suitable for all control devices;
- Cheap in comparison to similar games!

Yes, some aspects are lacking, like proper campaign, player progression, ranked races or some definitely worthy cars...
But this seeming lack of content doesn't make this game shallow - drifting itself [b] is [/b] the content here!
And this is exactly the right reason to buy it.
